com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":132517927,"digest":"sha256:eea81638d3632162b580922472143426d4d060d96f94c1f7241263e106289d90","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-11T15:00:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T15:02:09Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.7.1/Advancely-v1.7.1-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.7.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.7.1","body":"### This is a smaller release fixing the `Lodestone` advancement in 1.21.6+ `_categorical` templates, adding `Undo` and `Redo` buttons to the template editor and quite a few quality of life improvements.\r\n\r\n- Added Template Editor **Undo** and **Redo** buttons next to Save. Every step is reversible.\r\n- Added a **selection rectangle** to check off multiple goals at once.\r\n- Both the selection rectangle and dragging a selection inside the VLE (Visual Layout Editor) **auto-pan** the camera.\r\n- Entering the VLE no longer forces a save.\r\n- **Improved bulk-positioning**, to either set an amount of columns or amount of rows to arrange it in.\r\n- Added a new setting to push completed criteria and sub-stats to the bottom of automatic lists (to the top in inverted mode).\r\n- Added a **vertical spacing** option for criteria in the automatic layout.\r\n- **Shared icons** now display on the main tracker by default. Comes with a new setting.\r\n- Hermes is now on by default.\r\n- A completed run stops on `record.json` when the template is also complete, otherwise it freezes on the next game save (when `SpeedrunIGT` is not present) or keeps counting from the stats value while the template is incomplete.\r\n- Fixed the overlay not restarting properly for very big templates.\r\n- Stats no longer re-pop in the compact overlay stack with Hermes on.\r\n- The Hermes replay no longer cuts off at 5 minutes.\r\n- Advancely no longer keeps the `play.log.enc` open, so **deleting a world** while its being tracked is **now possible**.\r\n- Settings presets now preserve the compact overlay stack selection.\r\n- ScrambledMC updated/added `all_advancements` `_categorical` templates for `1.12` through `26.3` with a few more fixes to the `1.16.1` and `1.21.6+` templates (Lodestone advancement not being moved to the `adventure` tab).\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}